sequence-diagram

React App [icon: react, color: gray]
API Gateway [icon: aws-api-gateway, color: blue]
ECS Task [icon: aws-fargate, color: green]
S3 [icon: aws-s3, color: yellow]

React App > API Gateway: Request new Job\n(Text File & Webhook URL)
activate API Gateway
loop [label: Assign Job ID] {
  API Gateway > API Gateway: Assign Job ID
}
API Gateway > S3: Create Job\n(Text File & Job ID)
API Gateway > ECS Task: Request process Job\n(Webhook URL & Job ID)

activate ECS Task
ECS Task <> S3: Retrieve Job details
loop [label: Process Job] {
  ECS Task > ECS Task: Process
}
ECS Task > S3: Store Job results
ECS Task > API Gateway: POST to webhook\n(Job complete)
deactivate ECS Task

API Gateway > React App: POST to webhook\n(Job complete)

React App > API Gateway: Request result
API Gateway <> S3: Retrieve result
API Gateway > React App: Return result

deactivate API Gateway

